!!Other currently-proposed experimental cmavo
* ((BPFK Section: Aspect)) contains a reference to ((xa'o)); it would be very strange to keep this reference without discussing whether or not this meaning and/or form should be added.
* The contents of ((Experimental cmavo)), while rather haphazard, may be used a resource.
* [http://groups.google.com/group/lojban/browse_thread/thread/3462868aaa97e791|xoi] is a suggested cmavo regarding frequency/numbering.
* [http://groups.google.com/group/lojban/browse_thread/thread/7ddd2e891bcdf27e|xoi'a and xoi'e] are two proposed ZAhO to do with increases over time. One is linear, the other exponential.